<title>FRANCE: Suez repeats has no comment on Lyonnaise.</title>
<headline>Suez repeats has no comment on Lyonnaise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Cie de Suez reiterated on Friday it had no comment to make on newspaper reports it is putting the final touches to a merger accord with utilities group Lyonnaise des Eaux.</p>
<p>A Suez spokeswoman said the company had no comment to make and had made no comment previously on the merger talk.</p>
<p>She had been asked to comment on a report in financial daily La Tribune that said the merger plans had been confirmed by Suez and Lyonnaise.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment to make. We have confirmed nothing,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>Earlier Lyonnaise said it had no comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
